From 1b81d8bb29c1ef58b6cff2b17e30dac411487569 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:56:36 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add optional independent NNG validation publisher

Expose an opt-in NNG PUB endpoint without changing ZeroMQ, mining, mempool admission or consensus. Keep validation nonblocking and unregister only after callback drain. Fail initialization on endpoint errors and close partial sockets.

This BCHN publisher defines a new raw-payload protocol with fixed topic and sequence framing, not the Lotus FlatBuffers/RPC protocol. Document the compatibility boundary and full-port follow-up requirements. Add native regtest coverage for block/hash parity, reorg notifications, mempool transaction bytes, mining inclusion and failed-bind restart.
